## 九、数据驱动设计

### 9.1 角色数值 DataAsset

```cpp
UCLASS()
class UZZZCharacterData : public UPrimaryDataAsset
{
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere)
    float BaseHP;
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere)
    float BaseAttack;
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere)
    float BaseDefense;
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere)
    float BaseEnergy;
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere)
    float AnomalyMastery;     // 异常掌控（积蓄效率）
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere)
    float AnomalyProficiency; // 异常精通（爆发伤害）
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere)
    FGameplayTag ElementType; // Element.Fire / .Ice etc.
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere)
    TArray<TSubclassOf<UGameplayAbility>> GrantedAbilities;
};
